# Genesis for the mesh (5 home agents + yuki, shiro on AWS), 2026-09-23.
# Live on AWS first (yuki, shiro), 2026-09-23; the home agents join it later with fresh logs
# (docs/runbooks/deploy-aws-node.md). Becomes mesh.env when they do. Leader: yuki.
# Written by hand from mesh.env + the two AWS accounts: the same result `deploy.py ids`
# would give (existing keys unchanged), without it shipping a binary to every live host.
# Public keys only. Every node must agree on all of this: it is genesis.
# The roster is the membership: there is no separate members list.
